      "id": "ManifoldSharp",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "Superseded by ManifoldSharp, a pure managed C# port of the same manifold-rust kernel: same booleans and results, no native library to ship, runs on browser-wasm. ManifoldRust remains only as manifold-sharp's test oracle and will receive no further releases.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Managed bindings for manifold_rs, the C ABI of the pure-Rust port of the Manifold geometry kernel. Import a triangle soup, run an n-ary boolean (union / difference / intersection) and export the result, without the crash-on-invalid-input behaviour of the C++ binding.",
  "id": "ManifoldRust",
